{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "182", "x": 0.895551985636664, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03819126296697169, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "reported that they spent a lot of time and effort trying to frighten off the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12393667166651151, "w": 0.7721986261041041, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "birds of prey without actually harming them. Most of the farmers had at least", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.14277420698693738, "w": 0.771478490828579, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "one dog and said this was a big help at scaring away the predators. Some of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.16161166686457823, "w": 0.7717395193609661, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the farmers also reported that during the breeding season when the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.18059744725757176, "w": 0.7715002261187857, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "chickens were particularly vulnerable, they encouraged their children to", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.19943490713521264, "w": 0.7718254352722546, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "watch over the chickens and to hit pans with a metal spoon so that the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2182723670128535, "w": 0.7713477715124778, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "resulting noise would succeed in driving away birds that were trying to seize", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.23725822284863204, "w": 0.7717614597010803, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the young chicks. None of these methods was 100% effective. So, as a result,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2560956827262729, "w": 0.772117221290783, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the village people told us that rather than just using one method, they were", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.27497018501135945, "w": 0.7713478740374317, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "forced to use a combination for them to have any effect. And even so, these", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2938077203317853, "w": 0.7714132849579591, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "birds of prey remain a major threat to the chicken's survival and cause", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.31279350072477885, "w": 0.771478490828579, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "considerable economic loss to far So, we looked at the possibility of a", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3316309417417234, "w": 0.7716416080300824, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "longerterm solution to.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.35046840161936427, "w": 0.24278585725676236, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}